{"unit_id":"gcggcg__dsh-plugin-session-cleaner#card-zh","repo":"gcggcg/dsh-plugin-session-cleaner","commit":"f6709c72174199925494c685c3af2f05b049e37b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Session Cleaner 是一款面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 侧栏的会话管理插件。它在会话行的更多菜单中加入删除操作，并在侧栏面板列表加入统一的归档会话开关。用户可以确认后删除会话及相关记录，也可以一次显示或隐藏各工作区中的归档会话。删除过程通过 Host 路由处理；归档显示状态保存在浏览器本地。适合需要清理历史会话或集中浏览归档内容的 DSH Web 用户。支持中英文界面，使用 DSH 0.2.1 rc.3 至 0.3.0 前的版本范围。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:178-200","client.js:481-491","src/host/plugin.js:30-41","src/host/delete-session.js:152-174"]}
{"unit_id":"gcggcg__dsh-plugin-session-cleaner#card-en","repo":"gcggcg/dsh-plugin-session-cleaner","commit":"f6709c72174199925494c685c3af2f05b049e37b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Session Cleaner adds two features to the DeepSeek Harness Web sidebar: delete sessions from their row menu, and show or hide archived sessions across workspaces with one switch. Deletion uses a host route; archive visibility is saved in browser storage. It helps manage sessions and archived chats.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:178-200","client.js:481-491","src/host/plugin.js:30-41","src/host/delete-session.js:152-174"]}
