{"unit_id":"gcggcg__dsh-plugin-session-cleaner#feature-1","repo":"gcggcg/dsh-plugin-session-cleaner","commit":"f6709c72174199925494c685c3af2f05b049e37b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Cleaner 的功能「删除会话」：从侧栏会话行的更多菜单选择删除并确认，Host 随后移除会话记录和相关索引，并通知已连接的浏览器更新列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:186-200","src/host/delete-session.js:155-174"]}
{"unit_id":"gcggcg__dsh-plugin-session-cleaner#feature-2","repo":"gcggcg/dsh-plugin-session-cleaner","commit":"f6709c72174199925494c685c3af2f05b049e37b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Cleaner 的功能「全局归档显隐」：点击侧栏面板列表中的开关，即可显示或隐藏所有工作区的归档会话；选择会同步到内置归档筛选并保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:481-491","client.js:561-569"]}
{"unit_id":"gcggcg__dsh-plugin-session-cleaner#feature-3","repo":"gcggcg/dsh-plugin-session-cleaner","commit":"f6709c72174199925494c685c3af2f05b049e37b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Cleaner 的功能「删除确认」：在提交会话删除前显示确认弹窗，用户可以取消操作；确认后展示处理中状态，并在结果返回时显示成功或错误提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:208-273","client.js:903-934"]}
